    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109960" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψί̆-κομος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Q.S.
			5.119
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμη</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with high-bound tresses,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Pae.</u>
					6.95
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>with lofty foliage, towering,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρύες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.398
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.186
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				376
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					585
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Asius
					<u>Fr.Ep.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
